# Files that belong in the repo but not on the public site.
#
# Nothing here is secret — the service_role key lives only in Vercel's
# environment variables, never in git. This is about not serving files that
# have no reason to be reachable from a browser.
#
# Do not add vendor/ here. That directory holds the Supabase client the site
# loads from its own origin, and leaving it out of the deploy is exactly the
# bug this file was written alongside.

# Screenshots kept for debugging. Publicly readable otherwise.
bugs/

# The Cloudflare Pages copy of the members endpoint. Vercel serves the one in
# api/ instead; this directory would just be shipped as readable source.
functions/

# Schema and one-off setup scripts. Run by hand in the Supabase SQL editor,
# never fetched by the site. Serving them publishes every RLS policy.
db/

# Repo tooling, not site content.
.github/

# Test suite — run with `node --test`, never served.
test/
